.Dd March 12, 2026
.Dt PCI_FIND_CAPABILITY 9
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm pci_find_capability ,
.Nm pci_find_ext_capability
.Nd locate PCI and PCIe capability records
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In kern/pci.h
.Ft int
.Fn pci_find_capability "pci_device_t *dev" "uint8_t cap_id"
.Ft int
.Fn pci_find_ext_capability "pci_device_t *dev" "uint16_t cap_id"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
These functions walk the standard PCI capability list and the PCIe
extended capability chain for the supplied device.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
The offset of the matching capability is returned on success.
If no matching capability is present, 0 is returned.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr pci_config 9
